{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-141577","model_call":52,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1822"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1822"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_1255972390#8_2581777043","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1822","rank":5,"snippet":"to a retirement home due to increased construction, but often argues with the foreman ( John Ratzenberger) and refuses to leave. One day, he meets Russell ( Jordan Nagai ), a young wilderness explorer scout who attempts to assist Carl in order to earn his 'assisting the elderly' badge. Carl tricks Russell into 'assisting' him by telling him to find and get rid of a 'snipe' that invades his yard. When a construction worker accidentally breaks Carl's <cover>mailbox, a part of the house and a part of Ellie that Carl cherishes, Carl hits him over the head with his walker. The assault lands him in court where he is forced to move out of his home by the next day. Workers from Shady Oaks retirement home </cover>arrive to pick him up the following morning but are shocked to find Carl releasing millions of helium balloons into the air which detach his house from its foundation, lifting it over the city and into the sky. Comfortably away from the city, Carl sets a course for South America and rests in his chair until hes interrupted by a knock at the door.\" , \"start_char\": 4500.000000 ,","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_1255972390#8_2581777043","rank":5,"relevance":3}]},"time":6},"model_calls":52,"document_judgments":24,"relevance_3":19,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
