{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-141577","model_call":76,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1837"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1837"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_31_369552630#4_792748231","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1837","rank":17,"snippet":"gets to arrange their dream trip. However, Ellie gets sick and is brought to the hospital, where she eventually passes away. In present day, Carl is still residing in their home and refuses to leave. All the homes in the neighborhood have been bought out and are being demolished to be replaced by buildings. During one incident, Carl unintentionally harms a construction worker, which results in the court ordering that he be moved to a <cover>retirement home. But instead of moving, Carl attached thousands of balloons into his house to turn it into an airship. Russell, a young Boy Scout who visited Carl’s home to try and assist him and earn his final merit badge, was brought along with the house. This was the start of an adventure for Carl and Russell, who eventually make it to South America. Throughout their journey, they meet a pack of dogs who have special collars that allow them to speak.\" , \"start_char\": 2318.000000 , \"title\": \"Up </cover>Dog Names | Popular Male and Female Names | Wag!\" , \"url\": \"https://wagwalking.com/name/up-dog-names\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_31_369552630#4_792748231","rank":17,"relevance":3}]},"time":6},"model_calls":76,"document_judgments":32,"relevance_3":19,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
