{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-141577","model_call":78,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1837"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1837"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_43_1255972390#1_2581766740","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1837","rank":21,"snippet":", \"end_char\": 1735.000000 , \"headings\": \"<cover>Up (2009) Plot Summaries Spoilers Synopsis Contribute to This Page \" , \"segment\": \"Carl soon realizes that this evildoer is his childhood idol. 78-year-old balloon salesman Carl Fredricksen is about to fulfill a lifelong dream. Tying thousands of balloons to his house, he flies away to the South American wilderness. But curmudgeonly Carl's worst nightmare comes true when he discovers a stowaway aboard: a Boy Scout named Russell. — Jwelch5742 Determined to save his home and keep the promise he made to his wife, widower Carl Fredricksen embarks on a journey to the mysterious Paradise Falls in an airship of his own invention. Along the way he meets his childhood hero, forms a bond with a boy who has an absent father, and realizes the preciousness of the life he lived as well as the one he now lives. — David J. Rizzo After his wife's death and an incident at home, elderly Carl Fredricksen is forced into a retirement home, </cover>but he still wants to go on the South American adventure he and his wife had planned. ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_918065455#4_1091762870","rank":19,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_2764751821#4_3057451421","rank":20,"relevance":3}]},"time":7},"model_calls":78,"document_judgments":33,"relevance_3":19,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
